commit 4bc81091b6ece5d77efc78ddc6de31a4d772e386
Author: tim404x <tim404x@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Wed Nov 25 13:46:13 2026 +0000

    fix(kanban): gateway dispatcher hot-reloads all kanban.* settings and names the binding cap when stuck
    
    The embedded dispatcher resolved kanban.* once at boot. A gateway booted with
    max_in_progress unset kept the memory default (8) after config.yaml was raised
    to 12, stranding ready cards for hours while the stuck warning blamed profile
    health. Every _DispatcherSettings field now re-resolves when the kanban section
    changes (one snapshot per tick, fail-safe on bad reads, one INFO line per
    change); DispatchResult.capacity_held records which cap blocked a tick, and the
    gateway/CLI stuck warnings name it with its source (config/memory-default).
    Regression: tests/gateway/test_kanban_dispatcher_hot_reload.py (real DB: 8
    running + 6 ready, cap unset->12 spawns exactly 4).

